{"id":"en_hello-my-lucky-charm","title":"Hello, My Lucky Charm","titleEn":"Hello, My Lucky Charm","description":"Five-year-old Zhaozhao witnessed her mother's death and was branded a bastard. Just as the killers closed in, the powerful Regent arrived and told her to come home with Daddy. No longer bullied, she became the royal family's cherished little princess. Gifted with the ability to hear animals and speak with ancient trees, she uses mice, birds and hidden magic to expose killers and rescue the innocent. Yet the question remains whether her secret can withstand the traps of palace life.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/hello-my-lucky-charm/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/hello-my-lucky-charm/en_US/aa64878db21a1516/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Amnesia","Baby","Comeback","Elite","Fantasy Romance","Female"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cji3q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_hello-my-lucky-charm_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cji3q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_hello-my-lucky-charm_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cji3q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_hello-my-lucky-charm_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cji3q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_hello-my-lucky-charm_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7cji3q/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_hello-my-luck